<section class="mt-8 lg:mt-16 mx-auto max-w-5xl rounded-lg border-2 border-primary bg-primary-bg px-6 py-5 text-center text-gray-900" aria-labelledby="find-the-course-<%= location.slug %>">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-primary" id="find-the-course-<%= location.slug %>">This course is no longer signposted</h2>

  <p class="mt-2 text-gray-900">
    <% if location.slug == "bungarribee" %>
      <span class="font-medium">Bungarribee is the most complicated of the three courses.</span>
    <% end %>
    The course isn't signposted or marshalled. <%= link_to "Load the GPX route", "#load-the-route-#{location.slug}", class: "text-brand-brown underline underline-offset-3 hover:no-underline hover:text-brand-grey" %> onto your watch or phone before you come, or run with someone who knows the way.
  </p>

</section>
